              "side": "right",
              "linkColor": "#3A8DDF",
              "title": "<p>​考编</p>",
              "content": "",
              "folded": 0,
              "link": "",
              "children": [
                {
                  "uuid": "90abe68c655d405384f5a3c9c0608b73",
                  "side": "right",
                  "linkColor": "",
                  "title": "<p>​现状</p>",
                  "content": "",
                  "folded": 0,
                  "link": "",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "uuid": "5aab1a7153c348d0950dc2a9fc2d775a",
                      "side": "right",
                      "linkColor": "",
                      "title": "<p>​今年设岗因为意外失败了</p>",
                      "content": "",
                      "children": null,
                      "folded": 0,
                      "link": ""
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "uuid": "322da848a5a54b589c702fa84c38466d",
                  "side": "right",
                  "linkColor": "",
                  "title": "<p>​未来</p>",
                  "content": "",
                  "folded": 0,
                  "link": "",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "uuid": "7e4ef52428fd483790f1cbc07dc72911",
                      "side": "right",
                      "linkColor": "",
                      "title": "<p>不确定明年还能不能设岗，甚至你这个临时岗还能不能继续干下去都是问题</p>",
                      "content": "",
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "uuid": "7f7dbdcda5a84c1196d45d5927c5fa13",
                          "side": "right",
                          "linkColor": "",
                          "title": "<p>​目前的合同是到明年2月份，这周五有人事会，目前这半年会不会在这个学校，看周五人事会情况</p>",
                          "content": "",
                          "children": null,
                          "folded": 0,
                          "link": "",
                          "ttW": 367
                        }
                      ],
                      "folded": 0,
                      "link": "",
                      "ttW": 283,
                      "leftIcons": [
                        {
                          "name": "number-01"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "uuid": "3710d56db04345ac81185f89d8030d68",
                      "side": "right",
                      "linkColor": "",
                      "title": "<p>​即使设岗，明年考编结果也是非常不确定，社招考编竞争非常的激烈</p>",
                      "content": "",
                      "children": null,
                      "folded": 0,
                      "link": "",
                      "leftIcons": [
                        {
                          "name": "number-02"
                        }
                      ],
                      "ttW": 258
                    },
                    {
                      "uuid": "025dc8ec47ed472fa2335606a907bbf8",
                      "side": "right",
                      "linkColor": "",
                      "title": "<p>​国内竞争非常激烈，即使是深圳编制老师这种公认非常好的工作，其实能过上的生活也一般</p>",
                      "content": "",
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "uuid": "0d9f6e0fb6c2491ba5dab19217f41554",
                          "side": "right",
                          "linkColor": "",
                          "title": "<p>​好生活​定义</p>",
                          "content": "",
                          "folded": 0,
                          "link": "",
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "uuid": "f56b4e5fdef1442caa933b20ccebdd8b",
                              "side": "right",
                              "linkColor": "",
                              "title": "<p>工作</p>",
                              "content": "",
                              "folded": 0,
                              "link": "",
                              "children": [
                                {
                                  "uuid": "e7b5b173e2bd45e2854bc48f04b2885b",
                                  "side": "right",
                                  "linkColor": "",
                                  "title": "<p>​一天八小时，不加班</p>",
                                  "content": "",
                                  "children": null,
                                  "folded": 0,
                                  "link": ""
                                },
                                {
                                  "uuid": "0ac8f0c66da34ffa9fca249e6f7c6187",
                                  "side": "right",
                                  "linkColor": "",
                                  "title": "<p>​下班之后不用 on call</p>",
                                  "content": "",
                                  "children": null,
                                  "folded": 0,
                                  "link": ""
                                },
                                {
                                  "uuid": "6e152bd7ec8f41e9a9e2ada4543232c8",
                                  "side": "right",
                                  "linkColor": "",
                                  "title": "<p>​好的职业发展，有上升空间</p>",
                                  "content": "",
                                  "children": null,
                                  "folded": 0,
                                  "link": ""
                                }
                              ]
                            },
                            {
                              "uuid": "3199b2af72be43d49a9cc83aa1fcce36",
                              "side": "right",
                              "linkColor": "",
                              "title": "<p>​生活</p>",
                              "content": "",
                              "folded": 0,
                              "link": "",
                              "children": [
                                {
                                  "uuid": "382983f18e554f518c7c8ee2e2902768",
                                  "side": "right",
                                  "linkColor": "",
                                  "title": "<p>​正常的居住条件，而不是宿舍，隔断房</p>",
                                  "content": "",
                                  "children": null,
                                  "folded": 0,
                                  "link": ""
                                },
                                {
                                  "uuid": "4412831145ad4557ba1c02e61bf01eca",
                                  "side": "right",
                                  "linkColor": "",
                                  "title": "<p>​正常的需求可以满足，比如定期去旅游，购买东西等等</p>",
                                  "content": "",
                                  "children": null,
                                  "folded": 0,
                                  "link": ""
                                }
                              ]
